# =============================================================================
# LEAF-SWAB eDNA: TAXON RICHNESS ACCUMULATION BY TRAIT AND SAMPLING HEIGHT
# COMPLETE SCRIPT — RUN FROM THE FIRST LINE IN A NEW R SESSION
# =============================================================================
# Analysis: incidence-based Hill number q=0 (taxon richness), iNEXT.
# Rows: A Diet; B Body size; C Locomotion.
# Columns: Lower (<1 m); Middle (1.3–1.5 m); Upper (2–2.5 m).
# IMPORTANT: Upper is only relabelled; original sample names are unchanged.
# Outputs: combined 3x3 PNG (600 dpi), vector PDF, curves and CI diagnostics.
# Missing CIs are reported, NEVER copied from other heights or fabricated.
# =============================================================================

